     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br><br>On Tuesday, 7 October 2014 02:42:01 UTC+1, Abhinav Agrawal  wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hey Phil.. try a conditional statement to control the loading of file…<div><br></div><div><div>if(input$goButton==0)</div><div>       return()</div><div>     else</div><div>      &lt;&lt;put isolate related code here &gt;&gt;</div><div><br></div><div>Try this, hope it helps.</div><div><br></div><div>Regards,</div><div>Abhinav</div><br>On Monday, October 6, 2014 5:55:35 PM UTC-5, <a rel=\"nofollow\">phill...@gmail.com</a> wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hello,<br><br>For the life of me I can&#39;t seem to make an actionButton and isolate work together.<br><br><b>Goal:</b><br>The user to choose parameters, which are then executed when the actionButton is clicked. No code to be executed prior to the actionButton onclick action.<br><br><b>Problem:</b><br>Even after enclosing code with &quot;isolate&quot;, code still appears to be executed on page load. This involves loading a large CSV file, which I want to avoid until after the user defined parameters are selected.<br><br><b>Version:</b><br>Currently I&#39;m doing everything from within R Studio 0.98.1062 on a Debian 64bit machine.<br><br><b>Code:</b><br>The code below is what I have written, although it is very early beta, so the ui layout doesn&#39;t look correct for example.<br><br># ui.R<br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  <br>titlePanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span